1.Remove the old ephemeral Redis deployment

kubectl delete deployment redis-deployment -n mini-project-1

2.Deploy the new StatefulSet and Headless Service

kubectl apply -f 02-redis-statefulset.yaml

Verify the PVC was dynamically created and bound:

kubectl get pvc -n mini-project-1

Verification: Status should show Bound for redis-data-redis-0.

3.Write test data to Redis

kubectl exec -it redis-0 -n mini-project-1 -- redis-cli -a SuperSecureK8sPassword123! set mykey "KubernetesPersistenceWorks"

4.Kill the Redis pod to test data survival:

Delete the redis-0 pod:

kubectl delete pod redis-0 -n mini-project-1

Wait for redis-0 to regenerate, then retrieve the key:

kubectl exec -it redis-0 -n mini-project-1 -- redis-cli -a SuperSecureK8sPassword123! get mykey

Verification: It returns "KubernetesPersistenceWorks". Your data survived total pod destruction!

